{
  "id": "skill_tree",
  "version": "0.1",
  "asOf": "2026-09-05",
  "source": "A seed generated by scripts/seed-skill-tree.mjs from the Skill Stacker catalogue (dnd/data/skills.json, D-090) and the skills the Skill Tree spec names for its cross links, warps and fog. Not the FI Skill Tree v6.3 content: that arrives through scripts/extract-v63.mjs.",
  "confidence": "convention",
  "confidenceNote": "The shape is the contract; the content is a seed of 40 skills so every state, boost, warp and band renders and is tested. Counts are not the v6.3 counts (625 / ~280 / 125).",
  "note": "Read by engines/skilltree.js. bands are the era columns; a skill is not yours when appliesWhen fails; gate.foo is the ladder step it opens at; requires are household thresholds (monthsClosed, logCount, snapshots, exercisesDone); boostedBy names the app events that move it to Open (monthClosed, log30, debtPaid, snapshot, exercise:<id>, fact:<ownershipField>); a warp’s proof bypasses its list, never awards it. Never inline these in a room.",
